      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Hi @Jacobjeevan @gigincg @nihal467 , kindly assign this issue to me. Here is my approach for fixing the issue:\n\n### Analysis:\n1. Issue lies in the `CreateInvoice.tsx` file\n2. Grid component is being used for alignment\n3. For the misaligned padding, issue is in the file `CreateInvoiceSheet.tsx` due to the use of class `-mx-4`\n\n### Approach to fix:\n1. Use of `items-start` class to align form items, i.e. \"Payment Terms\" and \"Note\" to the top thus not disturbing the alignment on expanding any textarea.\n2. Removal of class `-mx-4`\n \n### Screenshot post fix:\n\n<img width=\"1850\" height=\"1054\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30262f58-f656-457e-8f1a-558ec7ef7db4\" />",
